= Purine
{parent=Nucleotide base}

<Purine> is the fused six- and five-membered <nitrogen> heterocyclic framework underlying <adenine> and <hypoxanthine>. Its numbered ring nitrogens distinguish <protonation> and hydrogen-bonding sites.

= Hypoxanthine
{parent=Nucleotide base}

<Hypoxanthine> is the 6-oxopurine base of <inosine>.

